adaptation-samsung-r7 (0.0.0+git20260720203123.c4c06d0.bookworm+git20260728092037.c349ebc.bookworm+r7spen1+r7dns1+r7setup2+r7ssh1+r7spenapp2+r7desktop1) bookworm; urgency=medium

  * Add opt-in wayfire desktop-shell mode (adaptation-samsung-r7-desktop
    metapackage + inert config files in -configs):
    - /etc/skel/.config/wayfire.ini: proven plugin set WITHOUT 'decoration'
      (that plugin null-derefs the 0.18-backport wlroots xdg lifecycle and
      crashes on toplevel map); 'plamo' kept so tap/click reaches layer-shell.
      HiDPI scale 1.75 + transform 270 (landscape) on output HWCOMPOSER-1.
    - /etc/skel/.config/waybar/{config,style.css}: touch-friendly dark bar with
      a fuzzel launcher button, wlr/taskbar (activate/close), clock, battery,
      network (nmtui), pulseaudio.
    - /etc/systemd/system/wayfire-test.service: seat/VT recipe modelled on
      phosh.service (WLR_BACKENDS=hwcomposer,libinput is CRITICAL - hwcomposer
      alone gives no seat and xdg windows crash; tty7+chvt7 activates seat0).
    - /usr/bin/r7-switch-session: live phosh<->wayfire swap on the hwcomposer
      HAL (never restart the android container). Installs a VOLATILE
      /run/udev/rules.d libinput calibration matrix (0 1 0 -1 0 1) only while
      wayfire is active, because this wlroots/hwcomposer does not apply the
      output transform to absolute input; removed on return to phosh so
      portrait touch is never rotated.

 -- Yunus Tan <yunus.tan@outlook.com.tr>  Mon, 04 Aug 2026 09:55:00 +0300

adaptation-samsung-r7 (0.0.0+git20260720203123.c4c06d0.bookworm+git20260728092037.c349ebc.bookworm+r7spen1+r7dns1+r7setup2+r7ssh1+r7spenapp2) bookworm; urgency=medium

  * r7-spen-settings: force GSK_RENDERER=cairo instead of setdefault(). The
    phosh session exports GSK_RENDERER=gl into the systemd user environment, so
    when launched from the app grid the app inherited "gl" and segfaulted
    (Fatal Python error: _PyThreadState_Attach). setdefault() only helped over
    SSH where the var is unset. Hard-override fixes the app-grid launch.

 -- Yunus Tan <yunus.tan@outlook.com.tr>  Sun, 02 Aug 2026 20:10:00 +0300

adaptation-samsung-r7 (0.0.0+git20260720203123.c4c06d0.bookworm+git20260728092037.c349ebc.bookworm+r7spen1+r7dns1+r7setup2+r7ssh1+r7spenapp1) bookworm; urgency=medium

  * Add r7-spen-settings: a tiny standalone GTK4/Adw app (one Adw.SwitchRow
    bound to org.droidian.spen finger-mode) plus a .desktop, so the S-Pen
    finger-mode has a visible on/off toggle on the 0.49 channel. Mobile Settings
    0.49 ships a non-functional Configurable Tweaks stub (the real ~1500-line
    pmos-tweaks/conf-tweaks parser only exists from 0.55), so the tweak page
    cannot be shown there without transplanting the whole framework; this app is
    the light, non-fragile alternative. GSK_RENDERER=cairo (GTK4 GL segfaults
    here). When the base moves to 0.55 the toggle returns inside Mobile Settings
    (phosh-mobile-settings@r7, +r7spen2) and this app should be dropped.

 -- Yunus Tan <yunus.tan@outlook.com.tr>  Sun, 02 Aug 2026 19:50:15 +0300

